    },
    "This removes %@ from your Mac. You’ll need to download it again to use it. Your dictation history and shortcut settings won’t change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会从 Mac 删除 %@，之后需重新下载才能使用。听写历史和快捷键设置不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes %lld from your Mac. You’ll need to download it again to use it. Your dictation history and shortcut settings won’t change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将从你的 Mac 移除 %lld，之后需要重新下载才能使用。听写历史和快捷键设置不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes its saved API key and model setup, and clears any default or prompt assignments using it. Your prompts and shortcuts are kept. You can add the provider again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将移除其保存的 API Key 和模型配置，并清除使用它的默认项和提示词指派。你的提示词和快捷键会保留，之后可随时重新添加服务商。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes saved dictation audio only. Transcript history stays intact.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅删除已保存的听写音频，转写历史不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the saved corrections and pronunciation for this word.": {
