          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, FluidVoice starts silently in the menu bar at login. Opening the app yourself always shows the window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭后，FluidVoice 开机时只在菜单栏静默启动。手动打开应用始终会显示窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, FluidVoice still records the anonymous daily activity signal and, in beta builds, daily ASR and Fluid Intelligence timing summaries. ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭后，FluidVoice 仍记录匿名每日活跃信号，beta 版还会记录每日 ASR 与 Fluid Intelligence 耗时摘要。"
          }
        }
